#   - "inject fixed" injected 840 -> 3480 during the window, skipped stays 1 (the arm
#     frame only) => no RecordFailed, no NoBoundary storm;
#   - sr arg10 #600..#3600 eval=1 mv=engine throughout, scene changes (87/109 shape)
#     included;
#   - Restore removes the skips; Stop -> Start re-arms and injects from #1 again.
# No D3D12 errors, no crash; user reports no visible anomaly (picture identical to
# stage B, as expected - DLSS still writes arg10).
# NOT COVERED: re-arming the draw suppress after Restore (the runbook's second half;
